17. Very Important: Don't Use Just cartItems.length

You might see beginners write:

{cartItems.length && <CartItems />}

Avoid this pattern when length can be 0.

Why?

Because:

0 && <CartItems />

results in:

0

React can render that 0.

Instead use:

{cartItems.length > 0 && <CartItems />}

Now the left side is always a boolean:

true

or:

false

Much safer and clearer.

